# Combo variant of e8686506 (index 27)
# combo_spec: D11/2+D14/1
# Name: 迭代拼合+颜色编码顺序
#
# Design analysis for the fused variant
# a) Concrete behavior:
#    Original e8686506 lets a solver globally pack scattered fragments into one LR-symmetric
